From 92630bf10acb06c0fd260b0a6ef0b37115e78f9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:43:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] Add the Fairy type with Gen 6 typings and six Fairy moves

- TYPE_FAIRY (18) with a Gen 6 type chart; Steel no longer resists
  Ghost/Dark, matching the chart that introduced Fairy.
- Type name, "a FAIRY move" text, union room trade list, TM disc
  palette and a FAIRY badge drawn into the free slot of menu_info.png
  (unused type palette entry 10 recoloured pink).
- Clefairy/Cleffa/Togepi/Snubbull lines, Jigglypuff line, Mr. Mime,
  Marill line, Ralts line and Mawile get their Gen 6 Fairy typing.
- Charm, Sweet Kiss and Moonlight become Fairy-type.
- New moves: Fairy Wind, Disarming Voice, Draining Kiss, Dazzling
  Gleam, Moonblast, Play Rough (reusing existing animations), added to
  the Fairy lines' level-up learnsets.
- Hidden Power keeps its 16 possible types (never Fairy, like Gen 6).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EDbdFFZUtxJmCbg3V6KwVM
